          "filename": "Dimotika - triumphal column of khan Krum of Bulgaria conquering in 813 AD.jpg",
          "caption": "Triumphal column of khan Krum of Bulgaria, on his conquest of Didymoteicho in 813 CE (Byzantine-Bulgarian Wars). \nThe column, found in the Bulgarian capital Pliska, bears an inscription in Greek +ΚΑCΤΡΟΝ ΔΙΔVΜΟΤVCOV, \"Fortress of Didymoteicho\".\nSee also: СПИСЪК НА РАННОБЪЛГАРСКИТЕ НАДПИСИ ПО ВЕСЕЛИН БЕШЕВЛИЕВ &amp; В. Бешевлиев. Прабългарски епиграфски паметници.",
